  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> 3.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he his æhta bere geman ðara unfriðmanna æhta into huse, ðolie his æhta, ⁊ æbbe sylf frið ⁊ feorh, gif he hine cyðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he bears his goods into a house in common with the men not included in the truce, he shall forfeit his goods, but he himself shall have protection and his life [shall be spared], if he makes himself known.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si pecuniam suam inter pecuniam unfriðmannorum (id est pacem non habentium) mittat in domo, perdat pecuniam suam, et ipse tamen pacem et uitam habeat, si se manifestet.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
